{
 "duration": 24.94,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Luke had two liters of water on his back and couldn't drink a drop.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.63
  },
  {
   "text": "On the cold, windy ridge, the water sitting in his drink tube had frozen solid.",
   "start": 3.93,
   "end": 8.671
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. After every sip, blow the water back into the bladder so the tube stays empty.",
   "start": 9.171,
   "end": 14.74
  },
  {
   "text": "Tuck the tube under your jacket, close to your body,",
   "start": 15.04,
   "end": 17.717
  },
  {
   "text": "and fill up with warm water, not hot.",
   "start": 17.917,
   "end": 20.028
  },
  {
   "text": "Luke sipped all the way to the top.",
   "start": 20.578,
   "end": 22.209
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next cold hike.",
   "start": 22.709,
   "end": 24.74
  }
 ],
